id: disguised-shadow
name: Disguised Shadow
order: 1
category: body
# "[Draconic Physique]": it replaces that Secondary Racial Trait - which, the table's.
importance: secondary
description: >
  You take on a seemingly ordinary form until it's time to unleash your true draconic nature.
text: >
  Disguised Shadow (Body) [Draconic Physique]: You take on a seemingly ordinary form until it’s time to unleash your true draconic nature.
  (1)-[Passive]: Gain access to the Monster Form Transformation and Monster Form gains the Absorbed Apparel Aspect.
  (2)-[Passive]: You do not have access to the Bestial Trait you selected for the 2nd effect of Personified Dragon Ball while in your Normal State.
  (3)-[Passive]: While in your Normal State, double the amount of Ki Points you regain through the 4th effect of Negative Ki.
  (4)-[Passive]: Increase the Dice Score of your Saving Throw and Might Clashes against Opponents suffering from the Impaired Combat Condition by 1(T).
  (5)-[Choice]: Depending on your choice for the Option effect of Personified Dragon Ball, apply the following effect:

  * Sinister Dragon [Passive]: Increase the Wound Rolls of your Attacking Maneuvers made through the Exploit Maneuver by 2(T).
  * Hazy Dragon [Passive]: Ignore the penalties from the Bog Environment. Instead, while you are in the Bog Environment, increase your Combat Rolls by 1(bT) and increase your Speeds by 1/2.
  * Elemental Dragon [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you knock an Opponent through a Health Threshold with an Attacking Maneuver of your Favored Element’s Profile, they gain a stack of Impaired until the start of your next turn.
  * Noble Dragon [Triggered]: If you inflict the Compelled Combat Condition upon an Opponent through the effects of Noble Dragon, they gain a stack of Impaired until the start of your next turn.
  * Regenerative Dragon [Triggered/Defeat]: You are not Defeated and lose all of your Dragon Slimes. For every Dragon Slime lost, regain Life Points equal to 1/10th of your Maximum Life Points.
  * Ominous Dragon [Passive]: Gain access to the Terrify Maneuver. Additionally, if you inflict a Combat Condition to an Opponent through the Terrify Maneuver’s effects, that Opponent also suffers from the Impaired Combat Condition until the start of your turn.
  * Natural Dragon [Triggered]: Upon gaining a stack of Absorption, you may increase your Size Category to Gigantic while you possess that stack of Absorption. Additionally, increase your Soak Value and Wound Rolls by 1(T) while you possess at least 1 stack of Absorption.

---

# (1) The table's: Transformations are not in this system yet. The Normal State - (2), (3) - is every moment until they are.
# (2) Read where Traits are set aside (aside.mjs traitAside): Personified Dragon Ball's Bestial Trait, while in the Normal State.
# (3) Read on Negative Ki's own file: its 4th effect's Ki once more, while in the Normal State.
[passive]
# (4) The side facing an Impaired Opponent in a Saving Throw or Might Clash (chat.mjs disguisedClash).
allow disguised.vsImpaired;

# (5) Draconic Physique (3)'s, the same: read off Personified Dragon Ball's Option (`optionChosen`).
# Sinister Dragon: an attack made through the Exploit, its Wound (chat.mjs woundParts).
if (optionChosen("sinister-dragon")) {
  allow draconic.exploitWound;
}
# Hazy Dragon: the Bog Environment's own effects left out (registry.mjs environmentPrograms), and these instead.
if (optionChosen("hazy-dragon") && inEnvironment("bog")) {
  combatRolls += 1(bT);
  speed.all *= 1.5;
}
# Noble Dragon: its Compelled given, Impaired with it (chat.mjs settleNobleDragon).
if (optionChosen("noble-dragon")) {
  allow draconic.nobleImpair;
}
# Ominous Dragon: the Terrify Maneuver, and Impaired with what it inflicts (chat.mjs settleTerrify).
if (optionChosen("ominous-dragon")) {
  allow maneuver.terrify;
  allow draconic.terrifyImpair;
}
# Natural Dragon: not built - the Absorption Awakening is not in this system yet.

# Elemental Dragon: knocked through by an attack of your Favored Element's Profile (moment knock-through's `profiles`).
# Its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/knock-through, 1/round, effect 5]
requires optionChosen("elemental-dragon") && knockedFavored;
impairKnocked();

# Regenerative Dragon: the Defeat answered - every Dragon Slime off, 1/10 of the Maximum Life Points back for each.
[triggered/defeated, effect 5]
requires optionChosen("regenerative-dragon") && hasResource("dragonslime");
life.value += floor(life.max / 10) * dragonslime.stacks;
dragonslime.stacks = 0;
